WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.060
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:19.843
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:29.658
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:39.065
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:49.609
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:56.578
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.191
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:06.026
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.693
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:18.868
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:40.014
<i>IT WAS A TIME OF WAR.</i>

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.021
Fire!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.911
Retreat!

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.747
Retreat! Retreat!

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.044
Retreat!

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.616
Yajiro!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.190
This isn't good. We'll re-group!

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:16.353
We'll wait for daybreak and come back.

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.031
You can leave this to me.

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:18.827
<i>You can leave this to me.
Yes sir!</i>

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:21.663
Come! This way!

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:24.029
He's... being chased!

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.538
Don't let him get away!

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:37.272
<i>WAR RAGED AND
CHAOS RULED THE WORLD</i>

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:01.769
There he is! Over there!

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:03.205
Get him!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.998
There's nowhere to run!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.995
Surrender yourself,
Tiger of the Rear Guard!

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.299
He jumped off!

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:39.502
Damn, it'll be trouble if he gets away.

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:42.240
Find him and kill him.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:54.256
I won't let the senshi get me.

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:02.690
<i>Episode 1
The Smiling Senshi</i>

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:12.769
Hot water?

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:30.422
What a beautiful moon.

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:43.840
Would you like to join me?

00:05:46.479 --> 00:05:50.347
He's hurt. He couldn't have gone far.

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:53.346
<i>Split up and find him.
Yes, sir.</i>

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:07.055
Good evening.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.532
Lovely evening, isn't it?

00:06:09.736 --> 00:06:11.795
You alone, lady?

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:14.964
Yes, would you like to join me?

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:16.632
Sure!

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.502
Woman!

00:06:19.912 --> 00:06:25.009
Have you seen a young samurai
with a long sword on his back?

00:06:25.118 --> 00:06:27.678
A young samurai?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.847
Hmmm, no. I haven't seen one.

00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:33.926
Are you from these parts?

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:36.427
No, I'm a traveler.

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:41.600
This here's a battleground.
Be careful. Let's go!

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:43.497
Wait! But...

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:44.898
Bro!

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:47.005
Shut up, go find him.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:48.607
Wait for me!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.502
Excuse me, they're gone.

00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:05.117
They're Yatou...

00:07:05.391 --> 00:07:10.693
...henchmen of Nago Akki,
who took over the castle up there.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.424
Woman, don't do anything stupid.

00:07:13.533 --> 00:07:18.095
As a traveler in these
troubled times, I'm well aware.

00:07:18.237 --> 00:07:19.727
I wonder.

00:07:20.139 --> 00:07:21.572
What about you?

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:23.698
I'm a mercenary. Ouch.

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:28.678
I was hired to rescue a lord
who's being held hostage.

00:07:28.815 --> 00:07:31.443
We were completely wiped out.

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:34.576
Do you know the
Ultimate Battle Strategy?

00:07:34.687 --> 00:07:35.210
Huh?

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:39.216
To eliminate the enemy's will
to fight without combat.

00:07:41.527 --> 00:07:44.826
That is what I was taught
by a certain someone.

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:48.058
And to achieve that,
I must be unarmored.

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:51.734
Unarmored, meaning naked?

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:53.933
To keep smiling.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:58.202
To hold the enemy
close to my soft bosom.

00:07:58.377 --> 00:08:02.177
By doing so, the need
to fight is eliminated.

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:07.081
There's no way you can do that!

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:10.087
You've lost your will to fight.

00:08:10.223 --> 00:08:13.659
Crap, I don't have time for this.

00:08:14.393 --> 00:08:18.022
If your desire is not to fight,
you should go home...

00:08:21.801 --> 00:08:28.365
To right the wrongs of this world, and
to eliminate the enemy's will to fight...

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:31.867
Things don't always go as planned.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:32.500
Huh?

00:09:23.796 --> 00:09:27.823
If you want your hostage back,
bring the money!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.864
Crap!

00:09:29.001 --> 00:09:31.561
Yajiro, you're alive.

00:09:32.138 --> 00:09:34.538
I'm sorry, General.

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:42.246
We samurai must fight against the gun
toting senshi with only our swords.

00:09:42.815 --> 00:09:44.783
There's no way we can win.

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:47.512
But still, we must fight!

00:09:47.887 --> 00:09:51.550
We must get our Master back.

00:09:55.962 --> 00:09:59.989
In this world of war, those who
have fallen into its depths believe...

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:02.066
...only in guns and money.

00:10:02.635 --> 00:10:08.073
For those of us who believe in the way
of the sword, this is a lost battle.

00:10:08.307 --> 00:10:11.606
And I am a fool for
going along with them.

00:10:12.478 --> 00:10:14.742
Sometimes you just have to do...

00:10:14.847 --> 00:10:16.815
Hey there, Mr. Stupid...

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:18.984
Who're you calling stupid?

00:10:19.151 --> 00:10:20.641
You...

00:10:23.055 --> 00:10:25.216
So we meet again.

00:10:25.524 --> 00:10:28.186
Why did you come?
I told you to turn back.

00:10:28.327 --> 00:10:29.692
This is a battleground.

00:10:30.196 --> 00:10:32.255
I can't get to the castle?

00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:35.434
Of course not! Just take a look!

00:10:36.135 --> 00:10:37.500
Hmm...

00:10:38.237 --> 00:10:42.139
Going through that castle
is part of my journey.

00:10:47.413 --> 00:10:48.505
You...

00:10:49.315 --> 00:10:54.548
Whatever you're packing, it's not going
to do you any good. Just get out of here!

00:10:54.687 --> 00:10:57.247
But I can't...

00:10:57.657 --> 00:10:59.887
Huh? Hmm...

00:11:00.426 --> 00:11:03.156
It's him! The Tiger of the Rear Guard.

00:11:15.741 --> 00:11:17.140
What!

00:11:17.276 --> 00:11:19.540
There's someone with a gun!

00:11:19.679 --> 00:11:20.805
What!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.241
Shoot! Kill him!

00:11:37.496 --> 00:11:40.397
I-It's a woman...

00:11:41.567 --> 00:11:43.364
Y-You...

00:11:44.603 --> 00:11:47.663
Oh, I've done it again...

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:53.004
I give my little speech, but
I can't help but shoot my gun...

00:11:53.312 --> 00:11:56.713
You're a senshi too?

00:11:57.049 --> 00:11:58.448
<i>A "senshi" is...</i>

00:11:58.784 --> 00:12:02.015
<i>... one who is experienced
with a firearm.</i>

00:12:03.189 --> 00:12:06.556
Rushuna Tendo. That is my name.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.805
Wait a second!

00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:27.042
Stop! What are you going to do?

00:12:27.179 --> 00:12:30.342
I'm going to save the Lord
and pass through here.

00:12:30.449 --> 00:12:33.509
You need money to save him.
You got money?

00:12:33.619 --> 00:12:36.053
I don't have any money but...

00:12:36.655 --> 00:12:38.282
...I have a smile!

00:12:42.728 --> 00:12:43.990
Are you stupid?

00:12:44.063 --> 00:12:45.553
You're the stupid one.

00:12:45.731 --> 00:12:49.895
I am not! I'm Yajiro Kojima,
remember that!

00:12:50.136 --> 00:12:51.694
But listen!

00:12:52.571 --> 00:12:55.802
Look, you don't look it,
but you're good.

00:12:55.908 --> 00:12:59.674
So, lure them out and then kill Nago!

00:13:00.179 --> 00:13:02.647
I'll rescue the Lord and get my reward...

00:13:02.782 --> 00:13:04.306
Reward?

00:13:04.416 --> 00:13:07.317
So that's what you're after.

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:14.086
A samurai has to eat! Besides, then
you'll be able to go through the castle.

00:13:14.193 --> 00:13:17.458
I want to win the battle
without fighting...

00:13:17.563 --> 00:13:20.430
That's what I want to do.
Squire Yajiro.

00:13:21.066 --> 00:13:23.432
It's Master Yajiro!

00:13:23.969 --> 00:13:27.996
You don't look like a Master Yajiro.
I think Yatchan is perfect.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:30.608
<i>YATCHAN</i>

00:13:30.943 --> 00:13:32.001
Yatchan?

00:13:32.111 --> 00:13:33.009
Huh?

00:13:33.212 --> 00:13:34.338
Yatchan?

00:13:34.446 --> 00:13:35.845
It opened!

00:13:38.951 --> 00:13:41.146
Look, Yatchan!

00:13:41.387 --> 00:13:43.582
Wow!

00:13:45.858 --> 00:13:48.725
There's my reward! It's mine!

00:13:48.828 --> 00:13:49.886
Wait!

00:13:50.729 --> 00:13:52.458
That smoke...

00:13:52.932 --> 00:13:54.900
<i>ASHIKABI (buried explosives)
Ashikabi...</i>

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:56.634
It's a trap!

00:13:56.769 --> 00:13:57.633
What!

00:13:59.004 --> 00:13:59.766
Sorry!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.703
Ouch.

00:14:20.059 --> 00:14:22.152
Girl!

00:14:25.664 --> 00:14:31.034
How did you know about the ashikabi?
You're not just an ordinary girl!

00:14:31.203 --> 00:14:34.036
Oh, I'm a traveler.

00:14:34.173 --> 00:14:38.007
Stop playing around. You can't fool me!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:42.044
Your excellent marksmanship...
You must be a senshi.

00:14:42.181 --> 00:14:44.445
A senshi, please!

00:14:44.583 --> 00:14:48.110
Anyway, I have a favor
to ask you, Sir Nago.

00:14:48.254 --> 00:14:49.050
Huh?

00:14:49.321 --> 00:14:52.518
Won't you please let the Lord go?

00:14:53.859 --> 00:14:56.692
So you brought the money?

00:14:56.829 --> 00:14:57.591
Huh?

00:14:57.796 --> 00:15:02.665
Like I said, I will release him
in exchange for the money!

00:15:02.801 --> 00:15:06.362
I don't have any money,
but I do have a smile!

00:15:06.605 --> 00:15:12.771
How about if she doesn't have money,
she pays with her body, Boss?

00:15:12.878 --> 00:15:14.038
No.

00:15:14.179 --> 00:15:17.376
I only accept a smile
if it comes with cash.

00:15:17.516 --> 00:15:20.076
How about just a smile?

00:15:20.219 --> 00:15:23.347
Heh! That's a good joke!

00:15:24.089 --> 00:15:28.492
I said your strategy wouldn't work.

00:15:30.562 --> 00:15:33.759
If you don't have the money,
you're of no use to me.

00:15:33.899 --> 00:15:37.665
I'll send you to hell with my galdo,
my pride and joy.

00:15:38.871 --> 00:15:40.065
Die!

00:15:46.779 --> 00:15:47.746
<i>She...
She...</i>

00:15:48.847 --> 00:15:50.474
...dodged it.

00:15:51.984 --> 00:15:57.513
That precious galdo of yours,
it was designed for taking over castles...

00:15:57.656 --> 00:16:01.456
A machine gun
designed for maximum damage...

00:16:01.593 --> 00:16:05.222
However, it's slow to aim
and not very accurate.

00:16:05.931 --> 00:16:10.868
Old man, you don't know
how to use a gun, do you?

00:16:11.003 --> 00:16:14.905
Wh-Who are you?

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.372
I'm just a traveler...

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:21.170
...but you can't seem to grasp that.

00:16:21.347 --> 00:16:25.807
But since you're so unwilling to listen
and downright rude, you don't even...

00:16:25.951 --> 00:16:27.646
...get a smile!

00:16:28.087 --> 00:16:32.148
Who needs it anyway! Kill her!

00:16:50.309 --> 00:16:52.641
Not bad, Girl!

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:58.450
However, your gun is a 38 revolver.

00:16:58.584 --> 00:17:01.553
Six shots and you're done.

00:17:03.155 --> 00:17:09.116
I think you're the one who doesn't
know how to use a gun, Girl!

00:17:12.164 --> 00:17:16.624
I'll give you a smile
as my parting gift.

00:17:28.113 --> 00:17:31.549
Get up! Everyone, get up!

00:17:33.652 --> 00:17:36.780
We'll get our Master back...

00:17:36.922 --> 00:17:40.722
We will take our castle back!

00:17:51.036 --> 00:17:52.367
Die!

00:18:46.758 --> 00:18:49.522
Give me a break!

00:18:52.631 --> 00:18:54.622
It's okay now.

00:18:54.766 --> 00:18:56.961
Wha... What are you doing?

00:18:57.102 --> 00:18:59.570
Shut up! Be quiet!

00:19:04.776 --> 00:19:06.744
What are you doing?

00:19:06.845 --> 00:19:09.746
Shut up, be quiet!

00:19:10.282 --> 00:19:14.241
That woman! That skill!

00:19:37.509 --> 00:19:40.410
<i>NAGO</i>

00:19:51.056 --> 00:19:53.456
Lord! Master!

00:19:53.625 --> 00:19:59.120
Master! Master! Are you okay?

00:20:02.067 --> 00:20:04.365
Hey, where's my reward?

00:20:04.836 --> 00:20:08.135
It looks like everything's
back to normal.

00:20:21.587 --> 00:20:24.681
I see... Rushuna?

00:20:25.257 --> 00:20:27.088
I'm proud.

00:20:27.926 --> 00:20:32.420
But my teaching is to win
battles without fighting.

00:20:32.664 --> 00:20:36.691
But someday, she will do it.

00:20:44.142 --> 00:20:49.341
Yatchan, you did real well. I'm sure
they would've gladly hired you.

00:20:49.481 --> 00:20:52.279
I don't want to be in the military.

00:20:52.985 --> 00:20:56.386
You missed all of their vital organs.

00:20:56.555 --> 00:20:59.752
You didn't kill a single person.

00:21:00.425 --> 00:21:02.194
I'm going to be your partner!

00:21:02.194 --> 00:21:03.161
<i>Partner?
I'm going to be your partner!</i>

00:21:03.295 --> 00:21:05.058
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:07.866 --> 00:21:10.733
I don't like senshi.

00:21:10.936 --> 00:21:16.431
But I have a feeling you're different.
Together, we can rule the world!

00:21:17.843 --> 00:21:18.639
So...

00:21:22.247 --> 00:21:25.080
What do you think? Wanna join forces?

00:21:29.821 --> 00:21:35.088
In this chaotic world... even if I could
get just one person to stop fighting.

00:21:36.628 --> 00:21:39.119
Heh! Give me a break!

00:21:39.264 --> 00:21:43.325
There's a huge difference in what
you preach and what you practice.

00:21:43.435 --> 00:21:45.270
Showing off your skills like that!

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:46.828
<i>You're right.
Showing off your skills like that!</i>

00:21:47.172 --> 00:21:53.577
But I'm working towards that ideal.
That's what this journey is about.

00:21:53.712 --> 00:21:55.873
Look! A hot spring!

00:21:56.281 --> 00:21:58.442
Hurry, hurry!

00:21:58.583 --> 00:21:59.140
Uh...

00:21:59.284 --> 00:22:01.479
I'll scrub your back for you.

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:06.080
No thanks. What you do and what you
say are completely different!

00:22:15.334 --> 00:22:24.970
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.044 --> 00:22:35.715
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:42.255
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:42.427 --> 00:22:46.488
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:47.566 --> 00:22:55.302
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:57.733
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.009 --> 00:23:03.140
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:03.348 --> 00:23:08.786
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:08.987 --> 00:23:18.988
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:19.331 --> 00:23:30.139
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:30.308 --> 00:23:40.912
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.021 --> 00:23:44.989
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:47.822
Suddenly, we're attacked out of nowhere.

00:23:47.926 --> 00:23:49.325
A wanted woman?

00:23:49.461 --> 00:23:52.487
A golden haired senshi? It's me?

00:23:52.631 --> 00:23:53.723
No way!

00:23:54.666 --> 00:23:58.659
Brutal attacks and fighting skills
I've never seen before...

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:01.671
They even attacked me in the bath!

00:24:02.741 --> 00:24:07.610
Next episode of "Grenadier",
Rushuna under attack.

00:24:07.913 --> 00:24:09.938
Would you like to join me?
